text = "REGIONS + LOGICAL ROUTES
Cyan: OPEN
Slate: PACKED
Gray dashes: chunk grid
Thin lines: room boundaries
Yellow: main / purple: access
Yellow tint: main chunks
Orange: branch / pink: reconnect
White dots: actual crossings
Cyan boxes: boundary contracts
Red dots: packed openings
A: authored / F: fallback (optional)"
